  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving gender equity in the Mexican workplace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve gender equity in the Mexican workplace by supporting actions to increase the number of women in union leadership, strengthen protections, address discrimination and harassment at work, and augment wages for women.</narrative>
  </description>
